 ],
 "goal": "Tech in place, behind the opponent and away, on call",
 "why": "A missed tech leaves {char} lying on the floor, open to a free hit. A tech has {char} up in 26 frames, intangible for the first 20, and where it goes is what the opponent has to guess or react to.",
 "switch": "every",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Press L or R within 20 frames of the floor: a tech. With the stick held left or right it rolls that way.",
  "expect": "Fox throws {char} at the floor. Each throw is judged as {char} lands: a tech or not, and in the last part whether it is the tech that was called.",
  "example": [
   {
    "press": "R",
    "frame": "KF-8",
    "hold": 4,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     "SX",
     0
    ],
    "frame": "KF-8",
    "hold": 14,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
   "KF-8": "Frame {KF-8}: L or R",
   "KF": "Frame {KF}: the floor. A tech"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "The tech",
    "text": [
     "Thrown or hit at the floor, {char} is in hitstun until the landing. L or R pressed in the 20 frames before the floor is a tech: back up after 26 frames, intangible for the first 20.",
     "Without it {char} bounces and lies there, open to whatever comes next."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "KF-8",
        "hold": 4,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
       "KF-8": "Frame {KF-8}: L or R",
       "KF": "Frame {KF}: the floor. A tech"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF-19",
         "KW"
        ],
        "words": "L or R now: a tech",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF",
         "KI-1"
        ],
        "words": "A tech in place",
        "kind": "info"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The lockout",
    "text": [
     "A press earlier than 20 frames before the floor is no tech, and it locks the tech out for 40 frames: a second press, in time, does nothing.",
     "So one press, late. Fox's down throw puts {char} on the floor on frame {KF}: the press belongs on frames {KF-19} to {KW}."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "KF-26",
        "hold": 2,
        "from": "start"
       },
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "KF-4",
        "hold": 3,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "KF-26": "Frame {KF-26}: L or R, too early",
       "KF-4": "Frame {KF-4}: L or R again: locked out",
       "KF": "Frame {KF}: the floor. No tech"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF-26",
         "KF-20"
        ],
        "words": "Too early: locked out for 40 frames",
        "kind": "late"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF",
         "KF+25"
        ],
        "words": "A missed tech",
        "kind": "late"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Where to go",
    "text": [
     "The stick held left or right as {char} lands makes the tech a roll that way: 40 frames, intangible for the first 20.",
     "In place, behind the opponent or away: an opponent who waits has to see which before it can cover it, and one who guesses has to guess right."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
      "inputs": [
       {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "KF-8",
        "hold": 4,
        "from": "start"
       },
       {
        "stick": [
         -1,
         0
        ],
        "frame": "KF-8",
        "hold": 14,
        "from": "start"
       }
      ],
      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the throw starts",
       "KF-8": "Frame {KF-8}: L or R, the stick away",
       "KF": "Frame {KF}: the floor. A tech away"
      },
      "cues": [
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF-19",
         "KW"
        ],
        "words": "L or R now: a tech",
        "kind": "go"
       },
       {
        "frames": [
         "KF",
         "KR-1"
        ],
        "words": "A tech away: the roll",
        "kind": "info"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  ]
 },
